<description>&lt;p&gt;Gold smuggling is now reported to fund an Islamic State-linked insurgency in eastern DRC, with gold moving through Uganda to support rebel groups. An Ebola nurse was killed by a mob while treating patients, and a health worker was wounded responding to a case. The United States imposed sanctions on Rwanda's defence ministry and the military bank Zigama for backing M23 rebels and facilitating gold smuggling. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBWc3Y1ejlvUmpPa2p4NlR4MklKT2U2Y3RKMUdGem9RSHRvT1J0RUlndXI1ZFBFbTI1U1hYcUQ4clhVWDhlc1o1cHVGR2IyTFAwZFdUSVhjSDFMTUhIQ3fSAWNBVV95cUxPaGpKUmVMWnRZT1IyN1hESHVxZjhhaG8tYlFHaFV2cVFwajluLXVQWWVBbFpYbURxZzBIcVpSRDREcGp6VmpIUmo1TUhJUXVmOVYxbUpBbFVpMkhSR2Y5NVdPUWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxNMnhvbmdWV1pFaFhQNzVCM0JidlBvYTVSd2ppOENPdjVxT2tYcFA2c1ZjR2FIQ0I5VGtVUmo1SHBXWGJtRFhSXzdWd0Q0bjFLU0ZhdUxzb0pGSWRINFZYWUxmWFhERV9GMHA5SXN5WDQ5WVhPTHVVNmVfU2U3RDJJTC1WYVBFRGx3ZHVHMW41SnpsR0hkVGhUYkF0UGdfV0JsSVFBYUpsMDR5ZnNRV29Lb0h6bEthakZXSHpULURjZk1VNllvRWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOZ09fX1dBT200aVBYSWJ0ZDBndWQyWlA2RkVuclhtMEs0dlpFemtoTGpmWVFxREh2MXZWT29fSnhyUks5TXlyaXhEdW9jVjhlS2tWYkZ1Z2QyQS1aaU9FaEFLakoxQ3RCMzltb2xldkJ4UzNDRWRKM21VWXgtSXp2UlhDbkM1Vkx1emhmajZScWVHUkVmM0tMejZnTUhqV3NNY1BqS0hKem9tUDFyeU1lMGJ0VWY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOWW1IM1MwLXh4N3RJclNDZEFKWUdxMFQzcVVMYnplcXNjV0FEWGo2aEY4S0VDMHN1Sm5xdjk1TmJVYWN4N25lTVNWNGtJTTFVNXkxSTNTVjFpN2J3M19qYzIxNVFfdzhFOHJSOTNSSFA3MEZweFIzZkJ0SjN1N